title: The Files panel's workspace list marks the folder in view (tinted row and bar), and moving between the folders moves the mark; no x or plus shows on a row
folders: rust-small, plain, git-changes
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3500
left files
wait 1000
mark a-first-in-view
wait 450
tab 2
wait 1200
mark b-second-in-view
wait 450
tab 3
wait 1200
mark c-third-in-view
wait 450
workspace off {FIX}\plain
wait 1200
mark d-one-taken-off
wait 450
workspace put {FIX}\plain
wait 1500
mark e-put-back
wait 450
tab 1
wait 1000
mark f-back-to-first
wait 450
quit
